<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$10 bln NCDs on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$10 bln NCDs on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Wednesday it would issue T$10 billion in three-month negotiable certificates of deposit later in the day.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 15.00 p.m. local (0700 GMT), a central bank official said by telephone.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
